#19001
"Small Clearing"
"A small clearing has formed in the midst of several large ferns nestled
between the trunks of a couple shuvana trees growing fairly close together. 
The trees are so close, in fact, that the roots of several twist and twine
together.  Oddly, a hole has formed where the roots of two trees come together
and the combined roots weave and twine together to form a natural stairway
leading down through the hole.
"
""
