E
"hole 1 down"
"The hole is large enough for even an ent to squeeze through with a little
work.  Where you might expect to see only darkness, a closer examination shows
that the hole beneath is lit with a soft green-yellow glow allowing you to see
that a cave exists stretching some distance below.  Fortunately for anyone who
might want to enter the cave, the twining roots reach clear to the cave floor
before sinking even further into the earth there.
"
