#19003
"Above the Altar of Cynnis"
"You are on a broad shuvana root that spans the distance between the shores of
the Vaasa and an island in the middle of the Windlass.  The island to the west
is one of the Vaasa's guarded treasures known as Ent'Moot.  From the vantage
point of this root, you have an unobstructed view of the spectacular island to
the west.  A second, smaller root spirals down next to this one providing a
natural staircase that leads down to the altar.
"
""
