#19004
"On a Massive Root"
"You are on a massive root overlooking a long drop into the rushing waters of
the Windlass far below.  The root spans the distance between the one shore of
the Vaasa and an island set squarely in the middle of the Windlass.  If you
head west you will end up on the island where the root terminates.  If you
head east you will end up back on the shore of the Vaasa.
"
""
