#19491
"The Lower Branches of an Elm - Southern Side"
"The tangle of thick branches and smaller branches flourish with the growth of
abundant elm leaves obscuring your view after only a short distance.  In
places you can move smaller branches aside only to find more of the same
further out of reach.  A soft buzzing nearby alerts you to the presence of a
beehive nearby.
"
"reset0 and status0 used with beehive/branch.
reset1 used with arriving birds.
"
